/// <summary>
/// INFORMICA TURDUS - Transportation Management System
///
/// ARCHITECTURAL OVERVIEW:
/// This is the main executable for the TURDUS transportation management system.
/// The application provides comprehensive functionality for managing public transportation
/// operations including bus routes, schedules, ticketing, and passenger services.
///
/// SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE:
/// The application follows a modular, layered architecture:
///
/// 1. PRESENTATION LAYER:
///    - Main forms and dialogs for user interaction
///    - Frame-based UI components for reusable interfaces
///    - Grid components with search and filtering capabilities
///    - Specialized forms for different business domains
///
/// 2. BUSINESS LOGIC LAYER:
///    - Business classes representing domain entities (BusStop, Line, Ride, etc.)
///    - Validation and business rule enforcement
///    - Data transformation and processing logic
///    - Integration with external systems
///
/// 3. DATA ACCESS LAYER:
///    - Database connectivity through data modules
///    - Query management and optimization
///    - Transaction handling and data integrity
///    - Caching and performance optimization
///
/// 4. INFRASTRUCTURE LAYER:
///    - Logging and error handling (FileLog, AppFileLog)
///    - Configuration management
///    - Security and authentication
///    - External service integration
///
/// KEY ARCHITECTURAL PATTERNS:
/// - MVC-like separation through frames and data modules
/// - Factory Method pattern for frame creation
/// - Observer pattern for data change notifications
/// - Strategy pattern for pluggable business logic
/// - Template Method pattern for customizable UI components
///
/// FRAME HIERARCHY:
/// TFrame (VCL Base)
///   ??? TframeBase (Tabbed UI foundation)
///   ?   ??? TframeGlossaryBasic (Data-aware base)
///   ?       ??? TframeGridWithSearch (Search and grid functionality)
///   ?           ??? TframeGridWithSearchAndPagination (With pagination)
///   ?           ??? TframeGridWithSearchWithToolbarAndOverlay (With toolbar/overlay)
///   ??? Other specialized frames...
///
/// FORM HIERARCHY:
/// TForm (VCL Base)
///   ??? TfrmChoiceGrid (Selection dialogs)
///       ??? TfrmChoiceGridWithToolbarAndOverlay (Enhanced selection)
///           ??? TfrmRouteChoiceGrid (Route-specific selection)
///
/// DATA MODULES:
/// - MainDM: Central data access and business logic
/// - CommonDM: Shared data operations
/// - Specialized modules for different business domains
///
/// CONFIGURATION:
/// The application supports multiple deployment configurations:
/// - ENG: English language version
/// - UKR: Ukrainian language version
/// - SRM: Service management version
/// Each with its own DPR file and resource configuration.
///
/// DEPENDENCIES:
/// - Delphi VCL framework
/// - Database connectivity (ADO, FireDAC)
/// - Third-party components (CEF for web integration)
/// - Custom libraries (KM*, BasicClasses, etc.)
///
/// BUILD CONFIGURATION:
/// - Conditional compilation for different features
/// - Resource file inclusion for UI elements
/// - Debug and release build support
/// </summary>
